  "lore": "Superman, also known as Clark Kent and Kal-El, is one of DC Comics' most iconic superheroes. Born on the planet Krypton and raised on Earth, he possesses incredible powers including flight, super strength, heat vision, and near invulnerability, using them to protect humanity as a symbol of hope."
